# Recorded input for the image example page (widgets/image.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 240 in the
# default theme: the picture at x 8..72, y 34..82; the covered box at x 8..104, y 90..186; the
# zoom button at x 8..48, y 194..228. One line per frame says what it does (format:
# input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 240
dt 0.016
pointer 300 10
# 1: the pointer over the covered picture: nothing changes
frame
pointer 56 138
# 2: the pointer over the zoom button: it is hot
frame
pointer 28 211
# 3: press it
frame
buttons left
# 4: release: clicked
frame
buttons
